; tempo-map-hold: the seconds-domain :end hold edge under a tempo map.
; Same 120→240 split at beat 4; :dur 8b = 3.0 s wall-clock. Past the
; edge the playhead clamps AT loop_secs (3.0 s → tick 1441440 = beat 8),
; so every later eval freezes on identical writes — the hold twin of
; tempo-map's seconds-domain loop wrap.
(transport :bpm 120 :meter [4 4] :dur 8b :end hold)
(tempo :at 4b :bpm 240)

(track :target radius
  (key :at 0b :value 0.0)
  (key :at 8b :value 1.0))
